			"value": "This is a full object replacement. Do object swap by completely removing the {} in Image 1 and placing the object from Image 2 in the cleared space.\n\nThe inserted object must be an unaltered copy of Image 2's object: its shape, geometry, proportions, structure, materials, colors, textures, patterns, and every design detail must come 100% from Image 2. \n\nDo NOT preserve the shape, silhouette, geometry, or structural details of the original {} from Image 1 — even if Image 2's object is a different type, form, or size, the output must reflect Image 2's actual shape.\n\nFrom Image 1's original object, transfer ONLY: position, orientation, viewing angle, scale relative to the scene, perspective, placement, and the scene's lighting/shadow behavior as cast onto the new object.\n\nKeep everything else in Image 1 unchanged: background, camera, framing, architecture, and all unrelated elements.\n\nProduce a seamless, photorealistic result — as if Image 2's object had been physically placed and photographed in that exact spot."
		},
